### Terminal Fast Lookups (`kubectl`)

```bash
# Rapid serviceaccount generation & token retrieval
kubectl create serviceaccount deploy-bot -n default
kubectl create token deploy-bot --duration=1h
kubectl auth can-i get pods --as=system:serviceaccount:default:deploy-bot
```

