## Step-by-Step Procedure

### Step 1: Create ServiceAccount, Role, and RoleBinding

```bash
kubectl apply -f sa-rbac-drill.yaml
```

### Step 2: Generate Bounded Token

```bash
TOKEN=$(kubectl create token deploy-bot --duration=1h)
echo "Generated Token: ${TOKEN:0:20}..."
```

### Step 3: Verify API Permissions via Impersonation

```bash
./test-sa-rbac.sh
```
